     3419       .
     3420       OPEN QUERY br-clients FOR EACH ub.clients       WHERE clients.db-num = ub.db.db-num  NO-LOCK.
     3421     end.
     3422    END.
     3423   ON CHOOSE OF MENU-ITEM m_b-print-RC
